tom_tag:conversational","custom_tag:image-text-to-text","custom_tag:audio-text-to-text","custom_tag:moe"],"private":false,"gated":false},{"id":"muse/Wan2.2-TI2V-5B-FP8","display_name":"Wan2.2-TI2V-5B-FP8[工作流专用]","description":"","downloads":6215,"likes":45,"license":"Apache License 2.0","tasks":["text-to-image-synthesis"],"created_at":"2025-08-13T08:05:57Z","last_modified":"2025-08-14T03:49:26Z","file_size":11385525089,"params":11385386716,"tags":["license:Apache License 2.0","library:lora","library:safetensors","library:pytorch","task:text-to-image-synthesis","custom_tag:ckpt","custom_tag:text-to-image"],"private":false,"gated":false},{"id":"ZhipuAI/chatglm2-6b","display_name":"chatglm2-6b","description":"ChatGLM2-6B 是开源中英双语对话模型 ChatGLM-6B 的第二代版本，在保留了初代模型对话流畅、部署门槛较低等众多优秀特性的基础之上，ChatGLM2-6B 引入了如下新特性：更强大的性能：基于 ChatGLM 初代模型的开发经验，我们全面升级了 ChatGLM2-6B 的基座模型。ChatGLM2-6B 使用了 GLM 的混合目标函数，经过了 1.4T 中英标识符的预训练与人类偏好对齐训练，评测结果显示，相比于初代模型，ChatGLM2-6B 在 MMLU（+23%）、CEval（+33%）、GSM8K（+571%） 、BBH（+60%）等数据集上的性能取得了大幅度的提升，在同尺寸开源模型中具有较强的竞争力。更长的上下文：基于 FlashAttention 技术，我们将基座模型的上下文长度（Context Length）由 ChatGLM-6B 的 2K 扩展到了 32K，并在对话阶段使用 8K 的上下文长度训练，允许更多轮次的对话。但当前版本的 ChatGLM2-6B 对单轮超长文档的理解能力有限，我们会在后续迭代升级中着重进行优化。更高效的推理：基于 Multi-Query Attention 技术，ChatGLM2-6B 有更高效的推理速度和更低的显存占用：在官方的模型实现下，推理速度相比初代提升了 42%，INT4 量化下，6G 显存支持的对话长度由 1K 提升到了 8K。","downloads":119836,"likes":331,"license":"","tasks":[],"created_at":"2023-06-25T08:37:14Z","last_modified":"2026-01-20T03:08:00Z","file_size":12488378706,"params":0,"tags":["model_type:chatglm","library:transformer","library:pytorch","custom_tag:glm","custom_tag:chatglm","custom_tag:thudm","deploy:swingdeploy"],"private":false,"gated":false},{"id":"taeny1314/Krea-2-Turbo-PJX","display_name":"Krea-2-Turbo-PJX","description":"","downloads":14,"likes":2,"license":"Apache License 2.0","tasks":["text-to-image-synthesis"],"created_at":"2026-07-31T16:56:57Z","last_modified":"2026-08-01T03:34:59Z","file_size":0,"params":0,"tags":["license:Apache License 2.0","library:pytorc